1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,880
I'm NAME, and this is SeatPass,

2
00:00:02,880 --> 00:00:06,240
our demo for the MLH Solana Hackathon.

3
00:00:06,240 --> 00:00:09,120
An organiser sets one face value,

4
00:00:09,120 --> 00:00:12,960
then learns from resale what it was worth.

5
00:00:12,960 --> 00:00:18,720
SeatPass prices from that resale record, and the chain caps the markup.

6
00:00:18,720 --> 00:00:24,000
Every resale is a transaction: a price, a wallet, a timestamp.

7
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:27,840
One ticket becomes a path: issued at face,

8
00:00:27,840 --> 00:00:30,720
resold, each hop carrying its price.

9
00:00:30,720 --> 00:00:36,000
Across an event, that is enough to price the next one.

10
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:38,880
These screens run on generated fixtures,

11
00:00:38,880 --> 00:00:42,720
labelled here; they are ours, built this weekend.

12
00:00:42,720 --> 00:00:47,040
The console recommends a primary price as a floor,

13
00:00:47,040 --> 00:00:51,840
not a forecast: the highest price this tier has seen.

14
00:00:51,840 --> 00:00:58,560
It refuses an upper bound and a sale probability: the cap hides the top,

15
00:00:58,560 --> 00:01:00,960
and nothing recorded a listing.

16
00:01:00,960 --> 00:01:03,840
Every number before this was generated.

17
00:01:03,840 --> 00:01:05,760
This signature is not.

18
00:01:05,760 --> 00:01:09,120
This program is deployed on Solana devnet.

19
00:01:09,120 --> 00:01:14,400
The record: face one SOL, cap twenty five hundred basis points.

20
00:01:14,400 --> 00:01:19,680
A test transfer priced at one point two five SOL executes.

21
00:01:19,680 --> 00:01:23,520
One lamport higher, and the program refuses it,

22
00:01:23,520 --> 00:01:25,920
error six zero one zero.

23
00:01:25,920 --> 00:01:29,280
The chain refuses it, not the app.

24
00:01:29,280 --> 00:01:31,200
The cap is enforced.

25
00:01:31,200 --> 00:01:33,120
No marketplace, no checkout.

26
00:01:33,120 --> 00:01:36,480
The model is unfitted, and labelled so.

27
00:01:36,480 --> 00:01:40,800
A Token-2022 fee rounds up to the whole ticket,

28
00:01:40,800 --> 00:01:42,720
so no fee ships.

29
00:01:42,720 --> 00:01:44,160
That is measured.

30
00:01:44,160 --> 00:01:47,040
That chain refusal is the feature.

31
00:01:47,040 --> 00:01:48,000
Thank you.
